From 0fa61d9d83e69dd79eb7b865130d6ef1bfc9bf93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:41:43 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): search box in the docs header

The Zola site builds its search index (search_index.en.js) and the header
box searches it with a vendored, MIT-licensed elasticlunr. Results are a
keyboard-accessible dropdown (arrow keys, Enter, Escape), and their links
come from base_url, so the site stays correct under /Camcraft on Pages.

Fixes #1245

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
